INT. KITCHEN - NIGHT #1#

A laptop on the table. ADA (30s) drops a file onto the screen. *Nothing happens.* Then **everything** does, and _fast_.
She waits.

ADA
(to herself)
Pick a format.

GRACE (V.O.)
Nothing leaves your device.
Not one byte.

ADA ^
I heard you.

.THE SCREEN

> THE WORD "DONE" <

!SHE CLOSES THE LAPTOP.

@McKENNA
Is it converted?

~A song, sung low

CUT TO:

EXT. STREET - DAY

Café tables. A sign: 字幕.

> Burn to white.

